      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max confidently walks into the restaurant's main dining area during his shift. He immediately spots Vika talking with their new strict boss near the bar. Max completely fails to understand the gravity of the situation and speaks out loud without thinking.",
      "gap": 0.8
